===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|elleventhe}}, from {{affix|enm|elleven|-the|id2=ordinal|nocat=1}}, equivalent to {{affix|en|eleven|-th|id2=ordinal}}. This re-formation replaced inherited forms such as {{m|enm|endleft}}, {{m|enm|ellefthe}}, from {{inh|en|ang|endlefta}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*ainaliftô}}.

